physicalRef: access_daily/database
description: "Insider threat Link Analysis showcase - DAILY COUNTS, never record-level: one row per employee, record-holding system (AP, CRM, CUSTARCH, HRIS, PAYROLL, TREASURY) and day with the number of records read that day; days with no reads have no row. One file per month (ACCESS_DAILY_YYYYMM.csv); the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the access_daily Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: read_date
primaryEntityType: employee
columns[4]{name,type,classification}:
  employee_id,string,EMPLOYEE
  system,string,SYSTEM
  read_date,date,
  records_read,number,
defaultLinkMapping:
  from: employee_id
  to: system
  primaryTime: read_date
  primaryMeasure: records_read
